	"Description": "[b][size=6][center]\uFEFFStendew Valley[/center][/size][/b][line]\n<br />[center][i]This mod was created as a team project for a game modding class within The School of Interactive Games and Media(IGM) at Rochester Institute of Technology in Rochester NY. IGM provides an educational environment that supports and encourages creative and collaborative academic inquiry by both faculty and students. IGM’s programs, coursework, research, and development efforts provide students with the knowledge and skills to pursue meaningful and rewarding careers in media-centric, interactive software development, while simultaneously advancing the field and helping to provide a well-rounded educational experience.[/i]\n<br />[img]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/images/1303/38322725-1701804556.jpg[/img][/center]\n<br />[line]\n<br />[center]Summary: You’ve received an anonymous letter in the mail telling you to retrieve a special item. Journey over to the mysterious island and try to get the special item.[/center]\n<br />\n<br />[img]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/images/1303/38322725-1701804820.png[/img]\n<br />\n<br />Dependencies:\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*][url=https://smapi.io]SMAPI[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1915]Content Patcher[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/6414]Quest Framework[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/8827]Quest Essentials[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1720]JSON Assets[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/1348]SpaceCore[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/6529]Expanded Precondition Utilities[/url]\uFEFF\n<br />[/list]\n<br />\n<br />Installation: Download the mod files, unzip and place them in the Mods folder\n<br />\n<br />Compatibility: NOT compatible with SVE\n<br />\n<br />[url=https://github.com/HauntedPineapple/Stendew-Valley]Github[/url]",
